OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister accused of moving
OL,4,Agoalposts as he says two year NHS waits
OL,5,Awill end by May
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform has accused Plaid Cymru of
OL,8,Fmoving the goalposts, after the first
OL,9,Fminister said the longest waits in the
OL,10,FNHS would be down to zero in "less than
OL,11,Fa year".
OL,13,FSince it entered government, in May,
OL,14,FPlaid ministers have promised to
OL,15,Frapidly eradicate waits of two years or
OL,16,Fmore within a "matter of months",
OL,17,Falthough they have never given a
OL,18,Fprecise date.
OL,20,FOn Tuesday, Rhun ap Iorwerth said this
OL,21,Fwould be within the first year of his
OL,22,Fgovernment.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
